{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_F55554BB","title":"Comms Are in Crisis","entry":"Dlg_F55554BB::entry","exit":"Dlg_F55554BB::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_36FFEC42","articyId":"72057619807755158","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"This blasted fucking Comms crisis, I'm telling you.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This blasted fucking Comms crisis, I'm telling you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":300.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42828","byteOffset":30532888,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_0664E901","articyId":"72057619807755179","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Of course it's a crisis! Are you calling me a liar? Telling me I'm rightfully angry about nothing?","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course it's a crisis! Are you calling me a liar? Telling me I'm rightfully angry about nothing?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":900.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41089","byteOffset":29873336,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_14C07738","articyId":"72057619807755205","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"What would you do if you had a call with a VSM Loudcaster? With the Comms down, I have to actually go to their studio now!","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What would you do if you had a call with a VSM Loudcaster? With the Comms down, I have to actually go to their studio now!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1825.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46224","byteOffset":31818080,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_0B46603D","articyId":"72057619807755238","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Of course it sucks! You think I don't--wait, did you just agree with me?","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course it sucks! You think I don't--wait, did you just agree with me?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18603","byteOffset":14924776,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_E2E54231","articyId":"72057619807755252","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Oh, well, I mean, yeah. Yeah! Right on. This bullshit's gotta end. And I gotta run if I'm gonna make this interview. Wish me luck.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, well, I mean, yeah. Yeah! Right on. This bullshit's gotta end. And I gotta run if I'm gonna make this interview. Wish me luck.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3375.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23087","byteOffset":16619456,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_7ACDE370","articyId":"72057619807755261","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Well, I mean, it's socially awkward, you know? Kinda like this conversation. I don't like that stuff. Why do you think I play a sport where I beat the shit out of people?","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, I mean, it's socially awkward, you know? Kinda like this conversation. I don't like that stuff. Why do you think I play a sport where I beat the shit out of people?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30518","byteOffset":19425848,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_AB8F8283","articyId":"72057619807755282","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Well, duh. I mean, I kinda gave you the answer to that one. I gotta get to this interview. Wish me luck.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, duh. I mean, I kinda gave you the answer to that one. I gotta get to this interview. Wish me luck.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3075.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25303","byteOffset":17457248,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_9CA3CFC7","articyId":"72057619807755291","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Violent Sports Monthly. What rock have you been living under?","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Violent Sports Monthly. What rock have you been living under?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":-400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35508","byteOffset":25793384,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_E73AC533","articyId":"72057619807755305","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"It was rhetorical. Lay off the Joos for crying out loud.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It was rhetorical. Lay off the Joos for crying out loud.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":-400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36697","byteOffset":28226656,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_877BE2CD","articyId":"72057619807755314","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"I don't. If I did, I'd find out who was responsible and drive my foot through their ass.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't. If I did, I'd find out who was responsible and drive my foot through their ass.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":900.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31175","byteOffset":19674712,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_EA26AF29","articyId":"72057619807755334","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Sheesh, you are some kind of freak show. Shoulda figured.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sheesh, you are some kind of freak show. Shoulda figured.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43079","byteOffset":30627184,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_083F202F","articyId":"72057619807755354","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"I told yah. I don't know. Rice Walket, he probably does. That fucker spends more time in the airwaves than he does breathing actual air. If anyone knows what's happening, it's him.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I told yah. I don't know. Rice Walket, he probably does. That fucker spends more time in the airwaves than he does breathing actual air. If anyone knows what's happening, it's him.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36511","byteOffset":28158224,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_CB5A9B0A","articyId":"72057619807755368","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Wastes if I know. Haven't seen him since the Comms went down. Hey... wait a minute... You don't think... That fucker.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Wastes if I know. Haven't seen him since the Comms went down. Hey... wait a minute... You don't think... That fucker.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41871","byteOffset":30168216,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_681B6C03","articyId":"72057774426557632","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Not in my mind.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not in my mind.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25599","byteOffset":17568904,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_D39CAD8B","articyId":"72057821671325894","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Roxi Fynx","text":"Actually, not luck. Wish me the intelligence to not get pissed off and punch them so hard in the eye they swallow it.","speakerId":"Ntt_149A06A8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Actually, not luck. Wish me the intelligence to not get pissed off and punch them so hard in the eye they swallow it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3675.0,"y":-50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49755","byteOffset":33165968,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_984C7B7B","articyId":"72057619807755165","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Is it really a crisis?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Is it really a crisis?","TextSheVersion":"Is it really a crisis?","TextTheyVersion":"Is it really a crisis?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":587.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23979","byteOffset":16950720,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_8AF32967","articyId":"72057619807755171","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you know why they're down?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you know why they're down?","TextSheVersion":"Do you know why they're down?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you know why they're down?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":587.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33639","byteOffset":20609720,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_60EF8DB4","articyId":"72057619807755186","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Well, kinda.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, kinda.","TextSheVersion":"Well, kinda.","TextTheyVersion":"Well, kinda."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1225.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26137","byteOffset":17769496,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_FF0BE40E","articyId":"72057619807755192","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you really need them that bad?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you really need them that bad?","TextSheVersion":"Do you really need them that bad?","TextTheyVersion"